{"iqavandavfsansaduhan RyataH": [{"id": "IqavandavfSaMsaduhAM RyataH", "headword": "ईडवन्दवृशंसदुहां ण्यतः", "headword_slp1": "IqavandavfSaMsaduhAM RyataH", "fold": "iqavandavfsansaduhan RyataH", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "The acute accent is on the first syllable of ईड् , वन्द , वृ , शंस् and दुह् , when they are followed by the affix ण्यत्।\n\nTerms: accent-विभक्ति-pronouns", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["ईडवन्दवृशंसदुहां ण्यतः ६.१.२१४", "६.१.२१४", "६.१.२१४ ईडवन्दवृशंसदुहां ण्यतः"], "synonyms_slp1": ["IqavandavfSaMsaduhAM RyataH ६.१.२१४", "६.१.२१४", "६.१.२१४ IqavandavfSaMsaduhAM RyataH"]}], "iqatyartivyayatinam": [{"id": "iqattyartivyayatInAm", "headword": "इडत्त्यर्तिव्ययतीनाम्", "headword_slp1": "iqattyartivyayatInAm", "fold": "iqatyartivyayatinam", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "थल् the personal-ending of the लिट् (Perfect Tense) gets the augment इट् after 1. अद् 2. ॠ and 3. व्यय्।\n\nTerms: इट् augment", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["इडत्त्यर्तिव्ययतीनाम् ७.२.६६", "७.२.६६", "७.२.६६ इडत्त्यर्तिव्ययतीनाम्"], "synonyms_slp1": ["iqattyartivyayatInAm ७.२.६६", "७.२.६६", "७.२.६६ iqattyartivyayatInAm"]}], "iqajanorDve ca": [{"id": "IqajanorDve ca", "headword": "ईडजनोर्ध्वे च", "headword_slp1": "IqajanorDve ca", "fold": "iqajanorDve ca", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "The सार्वधातुक affixes से and ध्वे (the endings of the Present and Imperative आत्मनेपदि) get the augment इट् after the roots ईड् - अदादिगणः (2nd Conjugation) and जन् 'to produce'.\n\nTerms: इट् augment", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["ईडजनोर्ध्वे च ७.२.७८", "७.२.७८", "७.२.७८ ईडजनोर्ध्वे च"], "synonyms_slp1": ["IqajanorDve ca ७.२.७८", "७.२.७८", "७.२.७८ IqajanorDve ca"]}], "iqaya va": [{"id": "iqAyA vA", "headword": "इडाया वा", "headword_slp1": "iqAyA vA", "fold": "iqaya va", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi